# Main server — local development
#
# The main server holds NO LLM credentials by design. Routing is deterministic
# (parallel can_answer to all shims, each scored by its own LLM key).
#
# Copy to `.env.dev` and edit. `./scripts/run-demo.sh` (default MODE=dev) reads
# this file.
PORT=8080

# Optional: shared-secret tunnel auth. Leave unset for local dev — the main
# server logs a warning and accepts unauthenticated tunnel connections.
# Set this in production / on Fly. The shim must send the same value.
# TUNNEL_AUTH_TOKEN=
